<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan May consumer prices at 12.93 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan May consumer prices at 12.93 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's consumer price index was 12.93 percent in May year-on-year compared with 13.57 percent in April and 10.84 percent in May 1996, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, fell by 0.2 percent in May to 197.57 from 197.96 in April. The index stood at 174.95 in May 1996.</p>
<p>					  May    April    May 1996</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICES base 1990/91   197.57   197.96  174.95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  -0.2    +2.39   +0.37</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +12.93   +13.57  +10.84</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom  9251-274757</p>
